# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:189
translate english day4_call_nonni_bb2cf764_1:

    # n "..."
    n "..."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:190
translate english day4_call_nonni_d2f73f59_1:

    # "Нонни не отвечает."
    "Nonni doesn't answer."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:205
translate english day4_call_nonni_cbaf175d:

    # n "Квист, ты совсем идиот? Я же сказала, что Андрее стало хуже. Хватит трепаться по телефону."
    n "Kvist, are you a complete idiot? I told you Andrea's condition got worse. Stop wasting time on the phone."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:211
translate english day4_call_nonni_b2905fd0:

    # n "Аппарат готов?"
    n "Is the device ready?"

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:219
translate english day4_call_nonni_05b5a976:

    # n "Спасибо. Сегодня ты все сделал правильно. Вези его скорее ко мне!"
    n "Thank you. Today you did everything right. Bring it to me as fast as you can!"

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:227
translate english day4_call_nonni_5baee9a2:

    # n "Сейчас? Ты решил торговаться сейчас? Ладно. Вези его скорее ко мне!"
    n "Now? You decided to bargain now? Fine. Just bring it to me as quickly as possible!"

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:235
translate english day4_call_nonni_51d35ece:

    # n "Двадцать кредитов?"
    n "Twenty credits?"

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:236
translate english day4_call_nonni_a88d5d0f:

    # n "Когда твоя пациентка лежит без аппарата? Знаешь что, Квист... Забирай, придурок, только привези его срочно"
    n "While your patient is lying there without the device? You know what, Kvist... Fine, take it, idiot, just bring it here immediately."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:242
translate english day4_call_nonni_a44a2f10:

    # n "Я делаю всё, что могу."
    n "I'm doing everything I can."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:250
translate english day4_call_nonni_fbded0a4:

    # n "Слышишь? Не накручивай себя раньше времени. Она сильная."
    n "Do you hear me? Don't work yourself up before it's necessary. She's strong."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:251
translate english day4_call_nonni_62967aaa:

    # n "И ты тоже. Я позвоню сразу, если что-нибудь изменится."
    n "And so are you. I'll call immediately if anything changes."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:259
translate english day4_call_nonni_71017927:

    # n "Я понимаю, что ты переживаешь. Но сейчас лучше дай мне работать. Если что-то изменится, я сама позвоню."
    n "I know you're worried. But right now it's better if you let me work. If anything changes, I'll call you myself."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:263
translate english day4_call_nonni_595475ba:

    # n "Я разберусь. Не мешай мне работать. Если будут новости, я сама позвоню."
    n "I'll handle it. Don't interfere with my work. If there's any news, I'll call you."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:278
translate english day4_call_nonni_dd78a9bd:

    # n "Это уже второй звонок. Надеюсь, ты наконец решил не тянуть время, как Аппарат?"
    n "This is already the second call. I hope you've finally decided to stop wasting time. How's the device?"

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:285
translate english day4_call_nonni_1a6b20c9:

    # n "Спасибо. Наконец-то. Со второго раза, но все равно правильное решение, вези его"
    n "Thank you. Finally. Took you two tries, but it was still the right decision. Bring it over."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:293
translate english day4_call_nonni_0299555d:

    # "Вам зачислили 5 кредитов"
    "You received 5 credits."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:294
translate english day4_call_nonni_48b9612a:

    # n "Даже сейчас ты пытаешься заработать. Я за такое гавно вообще платить не должна"
    n "Even now you're trying to make money. I shouldn't be paying for this crap at all."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:300
translate english day4_call_nonni_c1ca9f0e:

    # n "Двадцать кредитов. Ты вообще охренел? Вези его, и молись, чтобы я тебя не прибила"
    n "Twenty credits. Are you completely out of your mind? Bring it here, and pray I don't kill you."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:306
translate english day4_call_nonni_714de792:

    # n "Квист. Либо работай. Либо не отвлекай меня."
    n "Kvist. Either work, or stop distracting me."

# game/communications/nonni/day4_nonni.rpy:314
translate english day4_nonni_move_e7829276:

    # "Отвезли аппарат."
    "The device was delivered."

